description:
I would like to include a clickable link in the cell of `ui.output_data_frame`. I have tried a few iterations but cannot find anything that works.

1. Raw text

```python
import pandas as pd
from shiny import App, render, ui


app_ui = ui.page_fluid(
    ui.output_data_frame("data_output")
)


def server(input, output, session):
    # Load the data
    data = pd.DataFrame({
        "id": [1, 2, 3],
        "url": ['https://google.com', 'https://duckduckgo.com', 'https://bing.com']
    })

    @output
    @render.data_frame
    def data_output():
        df = data.copy()
        return df


app = App(app_ui, server)
```

![Screenshot 2023-12-20 at 15 14 48@2x](https://github.com/rstudio/shiny-gallery/assets/18248949/dc385e60-42cf-4ff2-94a4-b36b5ef6a65d)

2. Use `ui.a`

```python
    @output
    @render.data_frame
    def data_output():
        df = data.copy()
        df['url'] = df['url'].apply(lambda x: ui.a(x))
        return df
```

![Screenshot 2023-12-20 at 15 16 28@2x](https://github.com/rstudio/shiny-gallery/assets/18248949/5e5bb86d-9153-400b-94b8-9094e2068036)

```python
    @output
    @render.data_frame
    def data_output():
        df = data.copy()
        df['url'] = df['url'].apply(lambda x: f'<a href"{x}">click me</a>')
        return df
```

